Below is a large feature inventory for an AI-powered Infant & Child Care system built around a connected smart home—TV, refrigerator, AC, robot vacuum, cameras, microphones, sensors, wearables, lights, locks, speakers, etc.

The idea is to treat the entire home as one child-care environment, rather than making another standalone baby monitor.

