# 126. MOST INTERESTING DIFFERENTIATOR

The strongest concept is not any individual feature.

It is:

"Cross-device contextual intelligence."

For example:

Camera alone:
"Child detected."

AC alone:
"Temperature = 27°C."

Robot alone:
"Motion detected."

TV alone:
"Child watching TV."

Refrigerator alone:
"Milk is low."

But the AI combines everything:

"Your child has been awake for 35 minutes, has not had breakfast yet, is currently in the kitchen, the room temperature is 27°C, and the refrigerator has the food normally used for breakfast."

That is where a connected smart-home child-care platform becomes substantially more powerful than a conventional baby monitor.